    "20 classes / 74 properties. EPCISEvent has exactly 5 subclasses.",
    "Collapsed to an eventType DISCRIMINATOR because the target allows one label per node;",
    "flip capabilities.multi_label on and these become second labels instead.",
    "Timestamps are declared DATETIME; the TYPE_MAP rule negotiates them to STRING (ISO 8601) for targets whose Neo4jType enum lacks DATETIME."
